"Update Mistype to %@?" = "要將 Mistype 更新到 %@ 嗎？";
"Version %@ is installed. Your settings and learned phrases are kept." = "目前已安裝 %@ 版，你的設定與學習到的詞組都會保留。";
"Update" = "更新";
"Install Mistype %@" = "安裝 Mistype %@";
"This installs the Mistype input method for your account. No administrator password is needed." = "這會為你的帳號安裝 Mistype 輸入法，不需要管理員密碼。";
"Install" = "安裝";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"An older system-wide copy exists at %@. Remove it, or two Mistype entries will appear." = "在 %@ 發現舊的系統層級安裝。請移除它，否則會出現兩個 Mistype。";
"Mistype is installed" = "Mistype 已安裝";
"macOS lists a new input method only after you log in again. Log out and back in once, then add Mistype in System Settings › Keyboard › Input Sources." = "macOS 要等你重新登入後才會列出新的輸入法。請先登出再登入一次，然後在「系統設定 › 鍵盤 › 輸入方式」加入 Mistype。";
"Open System Settings › Keyboard › Input Sources, press +, and add Mistype." = "請打開「系統設定 › 鍵盤 › 輸入方式」，按 +，加入 Mistype。";
"Mistype was updated" = "Mistype 已更新";
"Now version %@. The new version starts the next time you type." = "現為 %@ 版，下次打字時就會啟用新版本。";
"Log Out…" = "登出…";
"Later" = "稍後";
"Couldn't log out automatically" = "無法自動登出";
"Choose Apple menu › Log Out." = "請從蘋果選單選擇「登出」。";
"Open Keyboard Settings" = "打開鍵盤設定";
"Done" = "完成";
"Installation failed" = "安裝失敗";
"Quit" = "結束";
